{"jobs": [{"absolute_url": "https://careers.duolingo.com/jobs/8616695002?gh_jid=8616695002", "data_compliance": [{"type": "gdpr", "requires_consent": false, "requires_processing_consent": false, "requires_retention_consent": false, "retention_period": null, "demographic_data_consent_applies": false}], "internal_job_id": 6441361002, "location": {"name": "New York, NY"}, "metadata": [{"id": 10945305002, "name": "Division", "value": "Engineering", "value_type": "single_select"}, {"id": 9700632002, "name": "Req Type", "value": "Industry", "value_type": "single_select"}, {"id": 98443292002, "name": "Featured Title", "value": null, "value_type": "short_text"}, {"id": 98445720002, "name": "Featured City Name", "value": null, "value_type": "single_select"}], "id": 8616695002, "updated_at": "2026-07-23T09:04:47-04:00", "requisition_id": "R-01172", "title": "Senior Director of Engineering, Math", "company_name": "Duolingo", "first_published": "2026-07-01T15:35:24-04:00", "language": "en", "application_deadline": null, "content": "&lt;p&gt;Our mission at Duolingo is to develop the best education in the world and make it universally available. It’s a big mission, and that’s where you come in!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Duolingo, you’ll join a team that cares about finding &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.duolingo.com/tag/engineering/?utm_source=greenhouse.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;amp;utm_campaign=engblog_gh_091224&quot;&gt;innovative solutions to complex technical problems&lt;/a&gt;, running countless experiments (300+ at a time!) with our massive user base to make data-driven decisions, and educating our users and employees alike. You’ll have limitless learning opportunities, mentorship and collaboration with world-class minds, and a variety of projects with large scopes — while doing work that’s both fun and meaningful.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our life-changing mission to develop education for our half a billion (and growing!) learners around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the last few years, Duolingo has expanded beyond language learning into entirely new subjects: Math, Music, and Chess. These products reach millions of daily active users, are growing quickly, and represent a CEO-level bet that Duolingo can become a platform for learning anything.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Director of Engineering to help lead Math and scale our teaching method to Physics, Chemistry, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role for a builder. You’ll take on creating math education at scale, leveraging a world-class engineering team and AI-driven content generation system. You&#39;ll make decisions about which school subjects to invest in, how to allocate engineering resources across bets at different stages, where to continue investing and where to pivot. You’ll partner closely with Product and Design to shape the future of the product while building the organization that delivers it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our New York, NY office on a hybrid (4+1) work schedule.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧠&amp;nbsp; You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the product and technical strategy for &lt;strong&gt;Math&lt;/strong&gt;, balancing short-term product impact with long-term strategic goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner strategically with &lt;strong&gt;Product, Design, Learning and AI&lt;/strong&gt; to evolve our strategy, including decisions on when and how to expand to additional subjects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multiple fast-moving engineering leaders and their teams as they tackle some of the most interesting technical challenges in industry, including AI content generation and AI tutoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead an organization that moves quickly, runs high-quality experiments, and translates product insights into measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop a strong leadership bench capable of bringing ambitious new products to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive &lt;strong&gt;operational excellence across Duolingo’s engineering org&lt;/strong&gt;, including reliability, performance, developer productivity, and efficient execution at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Duolingo’s &lt;strong&gt;engineering hiring bar and talent systems&lt;/strong&gt;, playing a central role in hiring decisions, leveling, and organizational design to maintain a high-performance, high-density team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅&amp;nbsp; You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading &lt;strong&gt;consumer product engineering organizations&lt;/strong&gt; (30+ engineers), ideally across multiple high growth product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product instincts and experience partnering closely with product leadership to define strategy, not just execute against it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of driving &lt;strong&gt;measurable impact on business outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;, including growing early product development through significant company scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling LLM-powered product features, with a strong interest in building engineering cultures that embrace new technologies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience building and scaling &lt;strong&gt;high-velocity, experiment-driven product organizations.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building high-performance, inclusive teams, and making thoughtful, high-judgment talent decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence senior executives and &lt;strong&gt;drive clarity in ambiguous, cross-functional situations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work from our New York, NY office on a 4+1 hybrid work schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The offered salary is dependent upon several factors, including work experience, skills, and internal peer comparisons. The posted range is subject to change in the future. For this role, base salary is supplemented by equity compensation. We encourage you to talk with your recruiter for more information related to compensation for this role!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range: &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$296,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$444,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;Z7ph2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Take a peek at how we care for our employees&#39; holistic well-being with our benefits &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.duolingo.com/#benefits&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Alerts:&lt;/strong&gt; Sign up for job alerts &lt;a href=&quot;http://my.greenhouse.io/users/sign_in?job_board=duolingo&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;We will do everything we can within reason to make sure that your interview takes place in an environment that fairly and accurately assesses your skills. If you need assistance or accommodation, please contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@duolingo.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@duolingo.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity: &lt;/strong&gt;Duolingo is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Warning: &lt;/strong&gt;Unfortunately, there is a rise in scammers pretending to be real Duolingo employees. Duolingo and our employees will never ask for your Social Security number, bank details, or passport info, and we’ll never ask you to deposit a check, purchase equipment, or exchange money during the interview process. Real Duolingo employees always use an email that ends in @duolingo.com or @recruiting.duolingo.com. Stay alert and double-check these details before sharing any information.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;By applying for this position your data will be processed as per the&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTX9GKeRMOMA9Vtm0vfGibrYPYz8ysl0Dg8KSXgj_PxeT5ChsdnNZZWtpxu4t7xillTPGnngnKCjIbV/pub&quot;&gt; Duolingo Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;", "departments": [{"id": 4034085002, "name": "Software Engineering", "child_ids": [4034810002, 4034809002, 4038852002, 4034797002, 4034812002, 4034811002, 4034816002], "parent_id": 4089876002}], "offices": [{"id": 4017774002, "name": "New York, NY", "location": "New York, New York, United States", "child_ids": [], "parent_id": null}], "ai_disclaimer": "<p><strong style="font-size: 14px;">AI in Hiring: </strong><span style="font-size: 14px;">Duolingo uses AI technology to assist in our hiring process. We want to be transparent about how we use this technology and your rights. We use Greenhouse Software's Talent Matching feature to assist with reviewing applications for the skills and experience we have decided are important for this role.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style="font-size: 14px;">How it works:</strong><span style="font-size: 14px;"> </span></p><ol><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui"></span>Talent Matching reviews your resume and responses to application questions to determine the extent to which your qualifications match the job requirements selected for this role. These requirements and their desired weighting are established by our recruiters in collaboration with hiring managers.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui"></span>All Talent Matching output is reviewed by our recruiting and hiring teams, who make the final decision on each application. Talent Matching does not automatically disposition any candidate or make hiring decisions.</li></ol>", "include_ai_disclaimer": true, "ai_opt_out_request_url": "http://app2.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/8616695002/ai_opt_out"}]}
